very of a stimulus, are considered part of the physical examination and may not be reported as a separate service 3) Physiologic recording of movement disorder symptoms, including bradykinesia, dyskinesia, and tremor…"},"covered":{"1":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT codes: 51784 and 51785.","2":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT code: 95874.","3":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT codes: 95860, 95861 , 95863, 95864, 95867, 95868, 95869, 95870, 95885, 95886, 95887, 95907, 95908 , 95909, 95910, 95911, 95912, and 95913 .","4":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT code: 95937.","5":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT code: 95865.","6":"It is the provider&rsquo;s responsibility to select codes carried out to the highest level of specificity and selected from the ICD-10-CM code book appropriate to the year in which the service is rendered for the claim(s) submitted. The following ICD-10-CM codes support medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT code: 95872."},"noncovered":{"1":"All those not listed under the \"ICD-10-CM Codes that Support Medical Necessity\" section of this article."}}}]